  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "On Qing Mao Mountain, after Fang Yuan reaches rank three, a guide leads him into the Gu Yue clan secret room and names the worms on the rock tables as rank two Digital Shade Gu that hold recipes. The worm he puts down when leaving is once called “Digital Shadow Gu” instead.",
        "chapters": [
          156
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_qing_mao_mountain",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "fac_gu_yue_clan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "These Digital Shade Gu belong to the Secret Hall clan elder, but a newly advanced clan elder can use primeval essence to browse within the access that elder’s will allows. Fang Yuan cannot open the rank four and five recipes, and even with primeval essence those worms give no reaction.",
        "chapters": [
          156
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ownership-and-access",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_secret_hall"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The secret room is a clan red zone under secret observation, and each visit is capped at fifteen minutes.",
        "chapters": [
          156
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ownership-and-access",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The clan feeds them. The will in the Digital Shade Gu is one with the Secret Hall clan elder. A separate Digital Shade Gu that holds the Moonlight Gu reverse-fusion recipe is hidden appropriately outside this open table set. Fang Yuan judges that Spring Autumn Cicada’s aura would let him refine the table Gu and take the recipes.",
        "chapters": [
          157
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ownership-and-access",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_moonlight_gu",
          "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
